This set of two artificial Aspen Fir trees brings balanced forest charm to your home with an elegant, full evergreen presence. Each tree features a silhouette packed with 147 tips and is anchored in decorative gold-tone pot bases for stability.

The pre-lit design includes 110 LEDs per tree that switch between warm white and vibrant multicolour options via a remote control. You can select from 11 distinct lighting functions, including steady glow, breathing flash, mixture fades, and wave modes. This allows you to tailor your seasonal ambience effortlessly without leaving your seat, enhancing the visual appeal of your decor.

Crafted with lifelike PE outer tips, these trees capture the authentic texture and soft needle feel of real evergreen boughs. Dense PVC inner tips provide incredible depth and full foliage, ensuring a realistic appearance. The molded PE tips naturally retain their shape, requiring only ten to fifteen minutes of light shaping after unpacking to achieve a perfect, lush look for your display.

Powered by a battery box, these Christmas trees offer complete freedom from wall outlets for flexible placement anywhere indoors. The compact four-foot size allows for balanced positioning flanking front entryways, doorways, fireplace mantels, or hallway corners.

The trees easily separate into manageable sections for simple space-saving storage when the festive period concludes. Their durable plastic construction ensures longevity, while the included pots add a touch of elegance to any room.
